{"id":"H4993","lemma":"מַתִּתְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"mattityah","sayIt":"mat-tit-yah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Mattithiah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at 1Ch.9.31;\nson of: Shallum (H7967M)\n§ Mattithiah = \"gift of Jehovah\"\n1) a Levite who presided over the offerings\n2) a Levite appointed by David to minister in the musical service before the ark\n3) one of the family of Nebo who had a foreign wife in the time of Ezra\n4) one of the men who stood at the right hand of Ezra when he read the law to the people","glosses":["mattithiah","named mattithiah","mattithiah—six in","shema"],"count":8,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"named Mattithiah","kjv":"And Mattithiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-15","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Mattithiah","kjv":"and Mattithiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-15","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Mattithiah","kjv":"And Mattithiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-16","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"Mattithiah","kjv":"and Mattithiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-25","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Mattithiah—six in","kjv":"and Mattithiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-25","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Mattithiah","kjv":"to Mattithiah"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-10","v":43,"renderings":{"bsb":"Mattithiah","kjv":"Mattithiah"}},{"chapterId":"neh-8","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shema","kjv":"Mattithiah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 9:31","note":"Mattithiah, one of the Levites, who was the firstborn of Shallum the Korahite, had the office of trust over the things that were baked in pans.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezra 10:43","note":"Of the sons of Nebo: Jeiel, Mattithiah, Zabad, Zebina, Iddo, and Joel, Benaiah.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Nehemiah 8:4","note":"Ezra the scribe stood on a pulpit of wood, which they had made for the purpose; and beside him stood Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uriah, Hilkiah, and Maaseiah…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1436","lemma":"גְּדַלְיָה","transliteration":"gedalyah","gloss":"Gedaliah"},{"id":"H2811","lemma":"חֲשַׁבְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"chashavyah","gloss":"Hashabiah"},{"id":"H3038","lemma":"יְדוּתוּן","transliteration":"yedutun","gloss":"Jeduthun"},{"id":"H3470","lemma":"יְשַׁעְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"yeshayah","gloss":"Isaiah"},{"id":"H7967","lemma":"שַׁלּוּם","transliteration":"shallum","gloss":"Shallum"},{"id":"H5654","lemma":"עֹבֵד אֱדוֹם","transliteration":"oved edom","gloss":"Obed-edom"},{"id":"H6874","lemma":"צְרִי","transliteration":"tseri","gloss":"Zeri"},{"id":"H0387","lemma":"אֵיתָן","transliteration":"etan","gloss":"Ethan"}],"senses":[{"id":"H4993H","gloss":"Mattithiah","relation":"H4993H ="},{"id":"H4993I","gloss":"Mattithiah","relation":"H4993I ="},{"id":"H4993J","gloss":"Mattithiah","relation":"H4993J ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}